{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# تحلیل مؤلفه‌های متصل / Connected Components Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**هدف:** یادگیری و پیاده‌سازی تحلیل مؤلفه‌های متصل برای شناسایی و شمارش اشیاء\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective:** Learn and implement connected components analysis for object identification and counting\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## محتوا / Contents:\n",
    "1. مفهوم مؤلفه‌های متصل / Connected Components Concept\n",
    "2. برچسب‌گذاری مؤلفه‌ها / Component Labeling\n",
    "3. استخراج آمار مؤلفه‌ها / Component Statistics\n",
    "4. شمارش اشیاء / Object Counting\n",
    "5. فیلتر کردن بر اساس ویژگی‌ها / Filtering by Properties"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Import libraries\n",
    "import cv2\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from typing import Tuple, List\n",
    "\n",
    "# تنظیمات نمایش / Display settings\n",
    "plt.rcParams['figure.figsize'] = (15, 10)\n",
    "plt.rcParams['font.size'] = 12\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"OpenCV version: {cv2.__version__}\")\n",
    "print(f\"NumPy version: {np.__version__}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. توابع کمکی / Helper Functions"
   ]
  }
 ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def display_images(images: list, titles: list, cmap='gray'):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    نمایش چند تصویر در کنار هم\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    n = len(images)\n",
    "    cols = min(n, 3)\n",
    "    rows = (n + cols - 1) // cols\n",
    "    \n",
    "    fig, axes = plt.subplots(rows, cols, figsize=(5*cols, 5*rows))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if n == 1:\n",
    "        axes = [axes]\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        axes = axes.flatten() if rows > 1 else axes\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for i, (img, title) in enumerate(zip(images, titles)):\n",
    "        if len(img.shape) == 2:\n",
    "            axes[i].imshow(img, cmap=cmap)\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            axes[i].imshow(cv2.cvtColor(img, cv2.COLOR_BGR2RGB))\n",
    "        axes[i].set_title(title, fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "        axes[i].axis('off')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # حذف محورهای اضافی\n",
    "    for i in range(n, len(axes)):\n",
    "        axes[i].remove()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "    plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def colorize_labels(labels: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    رنگی کردن برچسب‌ها برای نمایش بهتر\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Args:\n",
    "        labels: تصویر برچسب‌گذاری شده\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Returns:\n",
    "        تصویر رنگی\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    # ایجاد رنگ‌های تصادفی برای هر برچسب\n",
    "    num_labels = labels.max()\n",
    "    colors = np.random.randint(0, 255, size=(num_labels + 1, 3), dtype=np.uint8)\n",
    "    colors[0] = [0, 0, 0]  # پس‌زمینه سیاه\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # اعمال رنگ‌ها\n",
    "    colored = colors[labels]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return colored\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✓ توابع کمکی آماده شدند\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. ایجاد تصویر نمونه / Create Sample Image"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ایجاد تصویر دودویی با اشیاء مختلف\n",
    "# Create binary image with different objects\n",
    "image = np.zeros((400, 600), dtype=np.uint8)\n",
    "\n",
    "# اضافه کردن دایره‌ها\n",
    "cv2.circle(image, (100, 100), 40, 255, -1)\n",
    "cv2.circle(image, (250, 100), 50, 255, -1)\n",
    "cv2.circle(image, (450, 100), 30, 255, -1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# اضافه کردن مستطیل‌ها\n",
    "cv2.rectangle(image, (50, 200), (150, 300), 255, -1)\n",
    "cv2.rectangle(image, (200, 200), (350, 300), 255, -1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# اضافه کردن چند شیء کوچک\n",
    "cv2.circle(image, (450, 250), 15, 255, -1)\n",
    "cv2.circle(image, (500, 250), 10, 255, -1)\n",
    "cv2.circle(image, (550, 250), 20, 255, -1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# اضافه کردن یک شیء بزرگ\n",
    "cv2.ellipse(image, (300, 350), (120, 40), 0, 0, 360, 255, -1)\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images([image], ['تصویر دودویی / Binary Image'])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"اندازه تصویر / Image size: {image.shape}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. برچسب‌گذاری مؤلفه‌های متصل / Connected Components Labeling\n",
    "\n",
    "تابع `cv2.connectedComponents()` هر مؤلفه متصل را با یک برچسب منحصر به فرد مشخص می‌کند.\n",
    "\n",
    "The `cv2.connectedComponents()` function labels each connected component with a unique label."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# برچسب‌گذاری مؤلفه‌های متصل\n",
    "# Label connected components\n",
    "num_labels, labels = cv2.connectedComponents(image)\n",
    "\n",
    "# رنگی کردن برچسب‌ها\n",
    "# Colorize labels\n",
    "colored_labels = colorize_labels(labels)\n",
    "\n",
    "# نمایش نتایج\n",
    "images = [image, colored_labels]\n",
    "titles = ['تصویر اصلی / Original', \n",
    "          f'مؤلفه‌های متصل ({num_labels-1} شیء)\\nConnected Components ({num_labels-1} objects)']\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images(images, titles)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"تعداد مؤلفه‌ها (شامل پس‌زمینه) / Number of components (including background): {num_labels}\")\n",
    "print(f\"تعداد اشیاء / Number of objects: {num_labels - 1}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. استخراج آمار مؤلفه‌ها / Component Statistics\n",
    "\n",
    "تابع `cv2.connectedComponentsWithStats()` علاوه بر برچسب‌گذاری، آمار هر مؤلفه را نیز محاسبه می‌کند.\n",
    "\n",
    "The `cv2.connectedComponentsWithStats()` function calculates statistics for each component in addition to labeling."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# برچسب‌گذاری با آمار\n",
    "# Labeling with statistics\n",
    "num_labels, labels, stats, centroids = cv2.connectedComponentsWithStats(image)\n",
    "\n",
    "# نمایش آمار\n",
    "print(\"\\nآمار مؤلفه‌ها / Component Statistics:\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*80)\n",
    "print(f\"{'برچسب/Label':<15} {'مساحت/Area':<15} {'x':<10} {'y':<10} {'عرض/Width':<15} {'ارتفاع/Height'}\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*80)\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(1, num_labels):  # شروع از 1 برای نادیده گرفتن پس‌زمینه\n",
    "    x, y, w, h, area = stats[i]\n",
    "    cx, cy = centroids[i]\n",
    "    print(f\"{i:<15} {area:<15} {x:<10} {y:<10} {w:<15} {h}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  مرکز جرم / Centroid: ({cx:.1f}, {cy:.1f})\")\n",
    "    print(\"-\"*80)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. نمایش کادر محیطی و مرکز جرم / Display Bounding Boxes and Centroids"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ایجاد تصویر رنگی برای نمایش\n",
    "# Create color image for display\n",
    "output = cv2.cvtColor(image, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)\n",
    "\n",
    "# رسم کادر محیطی و مرکز جرم برای هر مؤلفه\n",
    "# Draw bounding box and centroid for each component\n",
    "for i in range(1, num_labels):\n",
    "    x, y, w, h, area = stats[i]\n",
    "    cx, cy = centroids[i]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # رسم کادر محیطی\n",
    "    cv2.rectangle(output, (x, y), (x + w, y + h), (0, 255, 0), 2)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # رسم مرکز جرم\n",
    "    cv2.circle(output, (int(cx), int(cy)), 5, (0, 0, 255), -1)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # نوشتن شماره برچسب\n",
    "    cv2.putText(output, str(i), (x, y - 5), cv2.FONT_HERSHEY_SIMPLEX, \n",
    "                0.5, (255, 0, 0), 2)\n",
    "\n",
    "# نمایش نتایج\n",
    "images = [image, output]\n",
    "titles = ['تصویر اصلی / Original', \n",
    "          'کادر محیطی و مرکز جرم\\nBounding Boxes and Centroids']\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images(images, titles)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✓ کادر محیطی و مرکز جرم نمایش داده شد\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. فیلتر کردن بر اساس مساحت / Filtering by Area"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# فیلتر کردن اشیاء کوچک (مساحت < 1000)\n",
    "# Filter small objects (area < 1000)\n",
    "min_area = 1000\n",
    "filtered_image = np.zeros_like(image)\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(1, num_labels):\n",
    "    area = stats[i, cv2.CC_STAT_AREA]\n",
    "    if area >= min_area:\n",
    "        filtered_image[labels == i] = 255\n",
    "\n",
    "# شمارش اشیاء بزرگ\n",
    "num_large_objects = np.sum([stats[i, cv2.CC_STAT_AREA] >= min_area for i in range(1, num_labels)])\n",
    "\n",
    "# نمایش نتایج\n",
    "images = [image, filtered_image]\n",
    "titles = ['تصویر اصلی / Original', \n",
    "          f'اشیاء بزرگ (مساحت ≥ {min_area})\\nLarge Objects (area ≥ {min_area})']\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images(images, titles)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"تعداد اشیاء بزرگ / Number of large objects: {num_large_objects}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. مثال عملی: شمارش سکه‌ها / Practical Example: Coin Counting"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ایجاد تصویر شبیه‌سازی شده سکه‌ها\n",
    "# Create simulated coin image\n",
    "coins_image = np.zeros((400, 600), dtype=np.uint8)\n",
    "\n",
    "# اضافه کردن سکه‌ها با اندازه‌های مختلف\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "num_coins = 15\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(num_coins):\n",
    "    x = np.random.randint(50, 550)\n",
    "    y = np.random.randint(50, 350)\n",
    "    radius = np.random.randint(20, 40)\n",
    "    cv2.circle(coins_image, (x, y), radius, 255, -1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# برچسب‌گذاری سکه‌ها\n",
    "num_labels, labels, stats, centroids = cv2.connectedComponentsWithStats(coins_image)\n",
    "\n",
    "# ایجاد تصویر خروجی\n",
    "output = cv2.cvtColor(coins_image, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)\n",
    "\n",
    "# شمارش و نمایش سکه‌ها\n",
    "coin_count = 0\n",
    "for i in range(1, num_labels):\n",
    "    area = stats[i, cv2.CC_STAT_AREA]\n",
    "    if area > 500:  # فیلتر کردن نویزهای کوچک\n",
    "        coin_count += 1\n",
    "        cx, cy = centroids[i]\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # رسم شماره سکه\n",
    "        cv2.putText(output, str(coin_count), (int(cx)-10, int(cy)+5), \n",
    "                   cv2.FONT_HERSHEY_SIMPLEX, 0.7, (0, 255, 0), 2)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # رسم دایره دور سکه\n",
    "        x, y, w, h, _ = stats[i]\n",
    "        cv2.rectangle(output, (x, y), (x+w, y+h), (255, 0, 0), 2)\n",
    "\n",
    "# نمایش نتایج\n",
    "images = [coins_image, output]\n",
    "titles = ['سکه‌ها / Coins', \n",
    "          f'شمارش سکه‌ها: {coin_count}\\nCoin Count: {coin_count}']\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images(images, titles)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\n✓ تعداد سکه‌ها / Number of coins: {coin_count}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. تحلیل پیشرفته: دسته‌بندی بر اساس شکل / Advanced Analysis: Shape Classification"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ایجاد تصویر با اشکال مختلف\n",
    "# Create image with different shapes\n",
    "shapes_image = np.zeros((400, 600), dtype=np.uint8)\n",
    "\n",
    "# دایره‌ها (نسبت تقریباً 1)\n",
    "cv2.circle(shapes_image, (100, 100), 40, 255, -1)\n",
    "cv2.circle(shapes_image, (250, 100), 45, 255, -1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# مستطیل‌های عمودی (نسبت > 1.5)\n",
    "cv2.rectangle(shapes_image, (400, 50), (450, 150), 255, -1)\n",
    "cv2.rectangle(shapes_image, (500, 50), (550, 150), 255, -1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# مستطیل‌های افقی (نسبت < 0.7)\n",
    "cv2.rectangle(shapes_image, (50, 250), (200, 300), 255, -1)\n",
    "cv2.rectangle(shapes_image, (250, 250), (400, 300), 255, -1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# برچسب‌گذاری\n",
    "num_labels, labels, stats, centroids = cv2.connectedComponentsWithStats(shapes_image)\n",
    "\n",
    "# دسته‌بندی بر اساس نسبت ابعاد\n",
    "output = cv2.cvtColor(shapes_image, cv2.COLOR_GRAY2BGR)\n",
    "\n",
    "circles = 0\n",
    "vertical_rects = 0\n",
    "horizontal_rects = 0\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(1, num_labels):\n",
    "    x, y, w, h, area = stats[i]\n",
    "    cx, cy = centroids[i]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # محاسبه نسبت ابعاد\n",
    "    aspect_ratio = h / w if w > 0 else 0\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # دسته‌بندی\n",
    "    if 0.8 <= aspect_ratio <= 1.2:\n",
    "        shape_type = \"دایره / Circle\"\n",
    "        color = (0, 255, 0)  # سبز\n",
    "        circles += 1\n",
    "    elif aspect_ratio > 1.5:\n",
    "        shape_type = \"عمودی / Vertical\"\n",
    "        color = (255, 0, 0)  # آبی\n",
    "        vertical_rects += 1\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        shape_type = \"افقی / Horizontal\"\n",
    "        color = (0, 0, 255)  # قرمز\n",
    "        horizontal_rects += 1\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # رسم کادر\n",
    "    cv2.rectangle(output, (x, y), (x+w, y+h), color, 2)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # نوشتن نسبت\n",
    "    cv2.putText(output, f\"{aspect_ratio:.2f}\", (x, y-5), \n",
    "               cv2.FONT_HERSHEY_SIMPLEX, 0.5, color, 2)\n",
    "\n",
    "# نمایش نتایج\n",
    "images = [shapes_image, output]\n",
    "titles = ['اشکال / Shapes', 'دسته‌بندی\\nClassification']\n",
    "\n",
    "display_images(images, titles)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\nنتایج دسته‌بندی / Classification Results:\")\n",
    "print(f\"  دایره‌ها / Circles: {circles}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  مستطیل‌های عمودی / Vertical rectangles: {vertical_rects}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  مستطیل‌های افقی / Horizontal rectangles: {horizontal_rects}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 9. تمرین‌ها / Exercises\n",
